From upstream mpv commit 3dae21b1ed4793912a8f9de1c5eb3cf32d227bce
https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv/commit/3dae21b1ed4793912a8f9de1c5eb3cf32d227bce

Backport to v0.41.0: remove the invalid ChannelMap property call, which passes
AudioChannelLayout instead of SInt32[]. macOS 27 rejects it with -50 and
prevents shared CoreAudio output from initializing. Preserve the existing
channel negotiation; do not force stereo or exclusive output.

